   528	
   529	__1\. Your Business Requirements__
   530	
   531	- Enable quote\-level deposit creation and tracking before sales order conversion via link\.  Payment processing gateway decision needed\.
   532	- Support vendor pre\-payment capture for draft purchase orders
   533	- Provide automatic association of deposits with sales orders upon conversion
