   549	
   550	Deposits will be created directly at the quote level with the Accounting team processing actual deposit transactions via Customer Deposit\. Upon quote to sales order conversion, deposits will automatically associate with the new sales order without manual intervention\. Invoice generation will automatically apply available deposits, streamlining the billing process\. Similarly, vendor pre\-payments will be captured against draft purchase orders and automatically applied to vendor bills\. Deposit visibility will span quote, sales order, and project levels with appropriate dashboards for each stakeholder group\.
