Financial Management/KBMH/3 Output/BRD_FinancialManagement_v1.0.md:198:Orion/NetSuite provides integrated banking capabilities that dramatically simplify KB+Hoag's cash management processes. Through the Bank Feeds Suite App, West Coast Community Bank transactions automatically flow into NetSuite daily, eliminating manual statement entry. The system matches incoming deposits, payments, and other transactions to existing records, with exceptions flagged for manual review. This automation reduces reconciliation time from days to hours and improves cash visibility.
